


>> CoffeeMachine := څیز نوی.
CoffeeMachine کله: ⌝'order:'⌜ وکړه: ⎬ :id
	>> coffee := ⌝'Americano'⌜.
	﴿ id = 1 ﴾ که-رښتیا: ⎬
		coffee := ⌝'Cappuccino'⌜.
	⎨.
	﴿ id = 2 ﴾ که-رښتیا: ⎬
		coffee := ⌝'Espresso'⌜.
	⎨.
	﴿ id = 3 ﴾ که-رښتیا: ⎬
		coffee := ⌝'Latte'⌜.
	⎨. <- coffee.
⎨.
>> SimpleCoffeeMachine := څیز نوی.
SimpleCoffeeMachine کله: ⌝'order'⌜ وکړه: ⎬ <- ⌝'Black'⌜. ⎨.
>> redCup := CoffeeMachine order: 1.
وتنه ولیکه: redCup, نوې-کرښه.
redCup := ⌝'Tea'⌜. 
>> greenCup := CoffeeMachine order: 0.
وتنه ولیکه: greenCup, نوې-کرښه.
>> yellowCup := CoffeeMachine order: 1.
وتنه ولیکه: yellowCup, نوې-کرښه.
>> blueCup := CoffeeMachine order: 0.
وتنه ولیکه: blueCup, نوې-کرښه.
>> plasticCup := SimpleCoffeeMachine order.
plasticCup := ⌝'Lemonade'⌜. 
>> blackCup := SimpleCoffeeMachine order.
وتنه ولیکه: blackCup, نوې-کرښه.
blackCup پای-ته-زیات-کړه: ⌝' nooo.... beer. '⌜.
>> orangeCup := SimpleCoffeeMachine order.
وتنه ولیکه: orangeCup, نوې-کرښه.
